OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with best of
OL,6,Flimited brighter spells early and
OL,7,Faround the Moray coast, where the best
OL,8,Fof the mild afternoon highs are
OL,9,Fexpected. Some patchy rain, mostly
OL,10,Fwest of the A9. Brisk southerly winds
OL,11,Feasing from the west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain turning heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes overnight, before clearing from
OL,15,Fthe west towards dawn, but perhaps
OL,16,Flingering around the east coast come
OL,17,Fdawn. Brisk southerly winds easing
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
