OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAny persistent rain around
OL,6,Fthe east coast soon clearing.
OL,7,FOtherwise a mix of isolated showers
OL,8,Fand brighter spells during the
OL,9,Fmorning, with outbreaks building for
OL,10,Fafternoon from the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday very windy with occasional
OL,14,Frain, heavier in west. Rain early
OL,15,FThursday, clearing to leave mainly
OL,16,Fdry, occasionally bright fare from
OL,17,Flate Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
